<title>JAPAN: Yamato Kogyo - 6mth parent results.</title>
<headline>Yamato Kogyo - 6mth parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to September 30, 1996</p>
<p> (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Sales		 13.42		vs	   13.36</p>
<p> Operating   loss 992    million	  vs   loss 556    million</p>
<p> Current     loss 743    million	  vs   loss 284    million</p>
<p> Net	   loss 897    million	  vs   loss 295    million</p>
<p> EPS	     loss 9.41 yen	  vs     loss 3.09 yen</p>
<p> Shares	     95 million	  vs	  95 million</p>
<p> Interim div	  2.50 yen	  vs	    2.50 yen</p>
<p>NOTE - Yamato Kogyo Co Ltd is an electric furnace steelmaker.</p>
